Analysis → design → coding → testing → maintenance.

## Models
| Model | Features |
|---|---|
| **Waterfall** | Linear, each stage done once |
| **Iterative** | Repeated cycles, incremental |
| **RAD** | Prototypes, user feedback, fast |

